                    {
                        "form_id": "6534141e-7b58-4a1a-a589-d6f2f988a61d",
                        "entry_id": "ec4f9df8-a85e-37c3-85be-4b4659976013",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "post-colonial"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fdf4d159-ab45-30ed-867d-91e38cb51d6d",
                        "entry_id": "ec4f9df8-a85e-37c3-85be-4b4659976013",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Après la période coloniale."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "77cb646f-d98d-4e0f-acaf-5b355f4a9d4c",
                                "sense_id": "fdf4d159-ab45-30ed-867d-91e38cb51d6d",
                                "text": "Les chefs confrériques, marginalisés pendant la période postcoloniale, firent ainsi leur retour sur la scène politique nationale avec la crise politique régionale et le multipartisme."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f84bca49-1e7a-4386-8975-92b995a37aeb",
                                "sense_id": "fdf4d159-ab45-30ed-867d-91e38cb51d6d",
                                "text": "Les personnes racisées issues de l’immigration coloniale et postcoloniale qui ramassent les ordures des villes, nettoient les places et les institutions publiques, conduisent les bus, les trams et les métros, celles qui servent les repas chauds dans les réfectoires universitaires, livrent le courrier, soignent les malades dans les hôpitaux, celles dont l’accueil souriant à l’entrée des établissements est le gage de sécurité, sont généralement absentes des arènes universitaires, gouvernementales et non gouvernementales soucieuses de l’environnement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35ad115f-8bef-426f-9399-b59ec9fa7443",
                                "sense_id": "fdf4d159-ab45-30ed-867d-91e38cb51d6d",
                                "text": "Or, en tant que telles, les études postcoloniales sont plus encore idéologiquement postnationalistes que chronologiquement postcoloniales."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b73438b5-78ad-449f-bfb9-8decddfbb834",
                        "source_entry_id": "ec4f9df8-a85e-37c3-85be-4b4659976013",
                        "source_sense_id": "fdf4d159-ab45-30ed-867d-91e38cb51d6d",
                        "source_sense_description": "Qui relève du postcolonialisme.",
                        "target_lang_word": "postcolonial",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "postcolonial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61155a1d-98ca-39af-aa40-f80ff913ab01",
                                        "entry_id": "5b6e83b6-b798-3bda-9ce5-8939b7c802f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Following the end of colonial rule."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10668e71-f95b-4044-a102-ea7a05d1928f",
                                                "sense_id": "61155a1d-98ca-39af-aa40-f80ff913ab01",
                                                "text": "In the postcolonial period, democracy alternated with military rule."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d04082d-d48d-4986-996f-72e1c6ebe41f",
                                                "sense_id": "61155a1d-98ca-39af-aa40-f80ff913ab01",
                                                "text": "The post-1990s retreat of manufacturing industry in many postcolonial cities across the world and the demands of first world capitalism paved the way to financial and service industries, such that the postcolonial city begins to function as a “node of an inter-metropolitan and global network carrying out information processing and control functions.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfa61d6f-b780-3355-9f20-0890ebed1612",
                                        "entry_id": "5b6e83b6-b798-3bda-9ce5-8939b7c802f4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to postcolonialism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d5e8565-262e-4c27-8457-db150d9446aa",
                                                "sense_id": "dfa61d6f-b780-3355-9f20-0890ebed1612",
                                                "text": "a postcolonial theory of esthetics"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "554ffaf9-0b5a-49f3-9a9e-981fa25a07ad",
                                                "sense_id": "dfa61d6f-b780-3355-9f20-0890ebed1612",
                                                "text": "There can be no doubt that Derrida's contribution to postcolonialism is not as clearly politicized as that of Fanon, Sartre or Gandhi, but it is nevertheless crucial in its careful consideration of the contrasting ethics and politics that might inform postcolonial thought."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
